(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers design, supply and commissioning of raw water pumping) Tj T*
(machinery complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — HORIZONTAL CENTRIFUGAL PUMPS) Tj T*
(1. Horizontal centrifugal pumps for clear cold water shall comply with IS 1520:1980.) Tj T*
(2. Duty point of each pump shall be 250 m3/hr discharge at 45 mtrs total dynamic head.) Tj T*
(3. Pump casing shall be CI and impeller of leaded tin bronze.) Tj T*
(4. Sound pressure level shall be limited to 85 dB\(A\) at 1 mtrs distance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUMP DATA SHEET) Tj T*
(Rated discharge: 250 m3/hr) Tj T*
(Total dynamic head: 45 mtrs) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(1. The drive motor shall be a three phase TEFC squirrel cage induction motor as per IS) Tj T*
(325:1996.) Tj T*
(2. Motor rating shall be 37 KW continuous.) Tj T*
(3. Motors shall operate satisfactorily on a supply of 415 V ± 10 per cent and 50 Hz ± 5) Tj T*
(per cent. The motor shall be premium efficiency IE3 conforming to IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(4. Motor enclosure shall be totally enclosed fan cooled with IP 55 protection.) Tj T*
(5. Insulation shall be class F and the motor shall be rated for S1 continuous duty.) Tj T*
(6. Motor speed shall be 1500 r.p.m. \(4 pole\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 5: LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
